    {
      "group": "674196",
      "task": "674196",
      "context": {
        "problem_id": "5c4b777b-49de-4b7e-8f08-62fd4c20a15a",
        "transformations": {
          "schema_version": 3,
          "revision": 7,
          "items": [
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T07:57:02.021919+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{x^{4}-2x^{3}-3x^{2}+6x}\\cdot \\cos x=0\"></span>.</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Най­ди­те все корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-10;\\sqrt{21}]\"></span> .</li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T07:57:02.021919+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-\\sqrt{3},0,\\sqrt{3},2,\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\mid k\\in \\mathbb{Z}\\setminus \\{-1\\}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\sqrt{3}\"></span> , 0,  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{3}\"></span> , 2,  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T07:57:02.021919+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Спра­вед­ли­ва рав­но­силь­ность:  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{a}\\cdot b\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}a=0\\\\\\begin{cases}a\\gt 0\\\\b=0\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . <p>Слу­чай 1:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"x^{4}-2x^{3}-3x^{2}+6x=0\\iff x(x^{3}-2x^{2}-3x+6)=0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=0\\\\x=2\\\\x=\\pm \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p>Слу­чай 2:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}x^{4}-2x^{3}-3x^{2}+6x\\gt 0\\\\\\cos x=0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{4}-2x^{3}-3x^{2}+6x\\gt 0\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\\\\k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\end{cases}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Ре­ше­ни­ем не­ра­вен­ства яв­ля­ет­ся мно­же­ство  <span data-inline-latex=\"(-\\infty;-\\sqrt{3}]\\cup [0;\\sqrt{3}]\\cup [2;+\\infty)\"></span> . Из серии  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\"></span>  этому мно­же­ству не при­над­ле­жит толь­ко число <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\"></span> . </p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­бе­рем корни, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-10;\\sqrt{21}]\"></span> . Корни 0, 2 и <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pm \\sqrt{3}\"></span>  лежат на этом от­рез­ке, по­сколь­ку<center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"-10\\lt -\\sqrt{3}\\lt 0\\lt \\sqrt{3}\\lt 2\\lt \\sqrt{21}\"></span> .</p></center><p>Для серии кор­ней  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k\"></span>  оце­ним гра­ни­цы от­рез­ка: </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"5\\pi\\lt 20\\lt 7\\pi\\iff \\frac{5\\pi}{2}\\lt 10\\lt \\frac{7\\pi}{2}\\iff -\\frac{7\\pi}{2}\\lt -10\\lt -\\frac{5\\pi}{2}\"></span> , <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\pi^{2}\\lt 21\\lt \\frac{9\\pi^{2}}{4}\\iff \\pi\\lt \\sqrt{21}\\lt \\frac{3\\pi}{2}\"></span> .  </p><p></p></center><p>Таким об­ра­зом, под­хо­дят числа  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{5\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{2}\"></span> . </p></li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
            {
